      "raw_text": "Asymptotically-Good Arithmetic Secret Sharing over Z/p ℓ Z with Strong Multiplication and Its Applications to Efficient MPC"
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "tei:year",
      "source": "grobid_tei",
